    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120980/extras/7ccc8524e159d2fb1466e4ec674a6d7b.poster.avif?t=1747053182\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120980/extras/7ccc8524e159d2fb1466e4ec674a6d7b.webm?t=1747053182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120980/extras/7ccc8524e159d2fb1466e4ec674a6d7b.mp4?t=1747053182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Jaxx Fury</strong>, the legendary hero, returns to his hometown after years of exile. With his brave and unyielding spirit, he stands as the last hope against the dark wizard <strong>Nachtengel</strong>. As shadows loom and danger grows, Jaxx must rise to save his people and reclaim his destiny, that was once a dream, and shall be realized! <br><br>Take control of our hero, wielding his legendary guitar as a weapon to battle hordes of enemies and conquer challenging obstacles! Navigate through vibrant levels filled with dynamic environments... with hidden 1UPs for you to find.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Heavy Metal music to go along with the fast-pace<br></li><li> Novel levels to let players experience different ambiance<br></li><li> Challenging obstacles with varying difficulty<br></li><li> Final boss worthy of rage!</li></ul><br>Let <strong>Nala</strong> guide you to <strong>Nachtengel</strong> and defeat him once and for all! Navigate the labyrinth of this cursed town with many different obstacles in your way. <br><br>Do not be disheartened! Do not give up, no matter how difficult it gets. The town depends on you!<br>... and finally, always head towards the gate! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120980/extras/01b1e33562adde08a3bf150decf9bf47.poster.avif?t=1747053182\" width=600 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120980/extras/01b1e33562adde08a3bf150decf9bf47.webm?t=1747053182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3120980/extras/01b1e33562adde08a3bf150decf9bf47.mp4?t=1747053182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
